      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 19,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "AnyPaint remove-people workflow using the current three-node public Paint path.\n\n1. Load an image and paint the removal region in ComfyUI Mask Editor.\n2. Krea2 CcC Paint Prepare receives IMAGE + MASK + VAE. It owns geometry_mode, padding fill, outpaint expansion, fill-holes, grow/shrink, feather, semantic-reference preparation, VAE preparation, and the sampling LATENT.\n3. Krea2 CcC Paint consumes paint_context and builds conditioning/model runtime.\n4. KSampler uses the LATENT from Paint Prepare.\n5. Krea2 CcC Paint Restore receives the decoded result, paint_geometry from Paint Prepare, and generated_mask.\n\nThere is no standalone public Paint Geometry node.\n\nFor outpaint, set expand_left/top/right/bottom directly on Paint Prepare.\n\nRecommended runtime: Krea 2 Turbo + krea2_anypaint_rank32, 8 steps, CFG 1, Euler, simple."
      ]
    },
